# The skill files under skill/ and dist/ and the role prompt fragments under
# roles/ are prompts: their exact bytes are the product, and the verify step
# compares dist/ against the build byte for byte. Any end-of-line translation
# on checkout would break that check on a fresh clone and silently change
# what a runtime receives; a fragment with CRLF endings is refused by the
# role assembler. Nothing in this repository is EOL-converted, in either
# direction.
* -text
